exercise.task:
Complete the name of the function that updates quantity.
const [quantity, setQuantity] = useState(1);
____(q => q + 1);

exercise.solution:
const [quantity, setQuantity] = useState(1);
setQuantity(q => q + 1);

setQuantity receives the previous quantity and adds 1. React updates the display.

